1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
퇴근했는데, 마음은 아직 사무실인가요?
You clocked out. But is your mind still at the office?

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,684
스터즈 터클은 말했어요.
Studs Terkel wrote that work is

3
00:00:06,784 --> 00:00:13,024
일은 돈만이 아니라 인정을 찾는 일이라고.
"a search for daily meaning as well as daily bread,
for recognition as well as cash."

4
00:00:13,124 --> 00:00:17,986
회의에서 못 한 말이 맴도는 밤.
A night when the words you didn't say in the meeting keep circling.

5
00:00:18,086 --> 00:00:23,500
그만큼 진심으로 일했다는 뜻일지도요.
Maybe it means you worked that sincerely.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
그 진심에게도 퇴근 도장을.
Stamp a clock-out on that sincerity, too.
